                            </div>
                            <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px;">Success View</h4>
                            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0;">Thank users after form submission with a success message</p>
                        </div>

                        <div onclick="addViewFromTemplate('error')" style="background: white; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='#ef4444'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='#e5e7eb'">
                            <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626); width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                                <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill" style="font-size: 24px; color: white;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px;">Error View</h4>
                            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0;">Show when submission fails or validation errors occur</p>
                        </div>

                        <div onclick="addViewFromTemplate('thank-you')" style="background: white; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='#8b5cf6'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='#e5e7eb'">
                            <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #7c3aed); width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                                <i class="bi bi-emoji-smile-fill" style="font-size: 24px; color: white;"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px;">Thank You View</h4>
                            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0;">Express gratitude with a personalized thank you message</p>
                        </div>

                        <div onclick="addViewFromTemplate('download')" style="background: white; border: 2px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor='#3b82f6'" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor='#e5e7eb'">
                            <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6, #2563eb); width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                                <i class="bi bi-download" style="font-size: 24px; color: white;"></i>
