                            <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 8px;">Download View</h4>
                            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0;">Provide download links or access to resources</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
